<title>USA: Frederick County, Md., yields 6.55 pct in 2027.</title>
<headline>Frederick County, Md., yields 6.55 pct in 2027.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Legg Mason Wood Walker, Inc said it priced $9.640 million of Frederick County, Md., economic development revenue bonds, series 1997, with a top yield of 6.55 percent in 2027.</p>
